    {
      "id": "mocker",
      "text": "Kai laughed at the rule. \"Rocks? Really?\" I forgot anyway, and by Tuesday night a pebble sat in my pocket.",
      "setting": "room",
      "light": "dusk",
      "focus": "kai",
